where do you get your strength from i  got this question from one of my twitter  readers who wrote in to say how do you  do it where do you find your strength to  keep doing all these big things  it's interesting because as an  entrepreneur i love being an  entrepreneur because i can create my own  lifestyle i can shape my own destiny i'm  not responding to  somebody who's telling me what to do i  get to shape my own life and i think  that's one of the biggest excitements  that you get as an entrepreneur if  you're doing something that you love  and you're working on big projects that  excite you  at least for me i find it easy to get  the strength and energy to do it  i don't find myself forcing myself to do  very much in my business if i'm forcing  myself to do something then i either  have to eliminate it automate it or  delegate it to somebody else  usually for a lot of the projects that  i'm working on i'll start off doing  everything i hate spending money until  i'm making money so in a new project  i'll pour myself into it i'm doing  everything for the business for this new  project even if it probably doesn't make  sense for me to do everything i don't  have the skills and i'll build it up to  a point where i can figure out this is  something that we can run with and make  money with and we're going to continue  doing it's important to keep doing or  it's not  and at that point i'll hand it off to  somebody to do most of the work or i'll  i'll ditch it like this was a failed  experiment i have tons of failed  experiments  and so i'm always working on  new projects i don't find myself doing  too much of the same thing over and over  and over and over again  unless i really enjoy it like these  videos i've been doing them for i don't  know how long now a number of years i  guess and getting more and more  dedicated to it  every wednesday i set aside time  to make these videos and i answer your  questions and i share what i think is  important and i love doing it  it's one of the best parts of my week  and i only do it because i love it you  know i might sit down and record 20  videos at a time and for a lot of people  that's like that may be crazy it's like  how do you 20 videos i can't even do one  it  just it kills me to do one video i hate  it i don't look forward to it at all  if you're forcing yourself to do  something you're not going to have great  results you're not going to have a lot  of energy into it right you're burning  your energy thinking about how bad this  thing is going to be  so  i get my strength and my energy from  doing projects that i love doing and  surrounding myself with people who i  love working with  and doing something that's worth doing  right like i'm not doing this  because i want to make a lot of money i  make money through this but it's not my  main goal i do it because i love helping  entrepreneurs and most of the stuff  that i create is free and and takes up  my time but i i love doing it it's i i  love seeing entrepreneurs start reaching  their goals and start making  breakthroughs in their personal lives i  love it it inspires me when when i see  your comments on these youtube videos  that makes me want to get up and record  more videos i just love doing it and so  you have to find something that you love  you've got to find something that you  are  passionate about that you can pour  yourself into that you can lose track of  your day you know you start at nine in  the morning and you look up and it's 36  at night and you don't know where your  date went because you you've been  pouring yourself into it  that's not going to happen every day  with your business this is definitely  going to be slow moments and painful  moments and and it's hard i know i get  it but  at least i find that when i'm working on  projects that excite me that that i know  is we're doing for the right reason  that's going to change people's lives  and and the bigger the projects are  often easier to get excited about  because it's going to have a big impact  right you don't get excited by little  projects i don't get excited by  answering one email right i don't get  excited by day-to-day grind kind of  stuff but that's hard i get decided by  the bigger things the new projects the  big picture stuff that's the most  exciting  time at least i guess in my day and so  the more that you can focus on the more  you're bringing of yourself to your  business the more passionate you are  about the work that you're doing the  easier it is to find the strength  to keep going to make it better to put  something new into it every day and when  you are not only focused on the money  life opens up and your business opens up  and you start making different decisions  and and better decisions for your  business and for you  and you'll feel more fulfilled you'll  have a greater impact and you'll end up  making more money  believe  great question for those of you watching  you like the video please give it a  thumbs up below it always makes me want  to do more for you and if you have a  comment about this video or a question  for your own business leave it below in  the comment section as you heard in this  video i love seeing those coming that's  what keeps me motivated that's what  gives me my strength to keep going so  you're doing me a favor by leaving a  comment i love to see those come in  thank you so much and i'll see you soon
 

